<title>USA: Y/S Sch. Fac. Auth., Calif. won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Y/S Sch. Fac. Auth., Calif. won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $19.25 million of Y/S Sch. Facilities Financing Authority, Calif., 1997 Sweetwater special tax</p>
<p>revenue bonds, Series A, with a net interest cost of 5.641 percent.</p>
